This repository contains the source code, experimental results, figures and
interactive dashboard of AURORA (Attributed Unified gRaph cOarsening for
equitable RecommendAtion), an original research work by Adji Marieme Sita
Cissé, supervised by Prof. Malek Mouhoub.

The contents are made publicly visible only so that reviewers and readers can
inspect and verify the reported results. No license is granted to copy,
modify, redistribute, publish or reuse any part of this repository (code,
method, text, figures or results), in whole or in part, without the prior
written permission of the authors.

Any academic reference to this work must cite:

  A. M. S. Cissé and M. Mouhoub. Aggregating User Preferences while Ensuring
  Equity, Diversity, and Inclusion using Graph Summarization. 2026.
  https://github.com/sitaacisse-boop/EDI

